OL,3,GNEWSAWorld War Two artwork saved from
OL,4,Aleaky roof
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe trust's Kerry Wilmot said over
OL,7,F#4,500 had been donated within a week.
OL,8,F"Whether it be #5 or #1,000, all of it
OL,9,Fmeans just as much. It's enabled us to
OL,10,Fsave these paintings," she added.
